{"4961420":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Elemental Bomb","steam_appid":4961420,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5023900],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Bomb‌ is a survivor-like game blended with Bomberman elements. You play as a mushroom in the forest, defeat slimes using bombs, collect drops and wave-clear rewards to grow stronger, and ultimately disrupt the slimes' ritual.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Survive and counterattack under the 5 waves of slimes' attacks (<strong>about 15 minutes per round<\/strong>).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some notes that may be necessary:<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<strong>1. Mushroom Bombs<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/extras\/6f53b17183528d12f64261cfcbddace2.avif?t=1793673050\" width=370 height=100 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four elemental bombs. When countering or being countered (bosses and elites have elemental attributes), they deal more or less damage.<br>Additionally, each bomb has other effects:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌Wind‌: Can destroy hillocks (‌slows movement on them).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire‌: Wider cross-shaped explosion range.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water‌: Can destroy terrain (boss slime attacks may randomly generate terrain).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth‌: Generates hillocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<strong>2. Buffs \/ Debuffs<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/extras\/fe18cf1bb043530d69838d16b3d886eb.avif?t=1793673050\" width=290 height=220 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DEBUFF (First row) are the boss's field effects.‌<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>‌BUFF (The rest) have a chance to drop when slimes die.<\/i>‌<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 1: Slow — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 2: Vulnerability — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 3: Bomb Count Reduction — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 4: Explosion Range Reduction — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Capped BUFFs will convert to Timed BUFFs upon reaching their cap.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 1: Speed Up — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 2: Bomb Count Up — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 3: Bomb Generation Time Reduction — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 4: No Slowdown on Mounds — Timed BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 1: Bomb Damage Immunity — Timed BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 2: Explosion Range Up — Uncapped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 3: HP Up — Uncapped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 4: Critical Hit Rate Up — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Others<\/strong>‌<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience it in the game (e.g. different slimes, other buffs, etc).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Supplement<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌Ascension‌: After clearing, there are 3 stages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ascension 1: Increased terrain duration + increased debuff duration)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ascension 2: Increased slime attack + increased HP)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ascension 3: Increased slime attack range + increased boss count)<br>‌Endless Mode‌: Unlocked after Ascension 3.<br>‌Rankings‌: Expected to be based on Ascension 3 clear time.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Bomb‌ is a survivor-like game blended with Bomberman elements. You play as a mushroom in the forest, defeat slimes using bombs, collect drops and wave-clear rewards to grow stronger, and ultimately disrupt the slimes' ritual.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Survive and counterattack under the 5 waves of slimes' attacks (<strong>about 15 minutes per round<\/strong>).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some notes that may be necessary:<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<strong>1. Mushroom Bombs<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/extras\/6f53b17183528d12f64261cfcbddace2.avif?t=1793673050\" width=370 height=100 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four elemental bombs. When countering or being countered (bosses and elites have elemental attributes), they deal more or less damage.<br>Additionally, each bomb has other effects:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌Wind‌: Can destroy hillocks (‌slows movement on them).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire‌: Wider cross-shaped explosion range.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water‌: Can destroy terrain (boss slime attacks may randomly generate terrain).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth‌: Generates hillocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<strong>2. Buffs \/ Debuffs<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/extras\/fe18cf1bb043530d69838d16b3d886eb.avif?t=1793673050\" width=290 height=220 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DEBUFF (First row) are the boss's field effects.‌<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>‌BUFF (The rest) have a chance to drop when slimes die.<\/i>‌<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 1: Slow — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 2: Vulnerability — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 3: Bomb Count Reduction — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 1, Column 4: Explosion Range Reduction — Timed DEBUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Capped BUFFs will convert to Timed BUFFs upon reaching their cap.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 1: Speed Up — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 2: Bomb Count Up — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 3: Bomb Generation Time Reduction — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 2, Column 4: No Slowdown on Mounds — Timed BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 1: Bomb Damage Immunity — Timed BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 2: Explosion Range Up — Uncapped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 3: HP Up — Uncapped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row 3, Column 4: Critical Hit Rate Up — Capped BUFF.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Others<\/strong>‌<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience it in the game (e.g. different slimes, other buffs, etc).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Supplement<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‌Ascension‌: After clearing, there are 3 stages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ascension 1: Increased terrain duration + increased debuff duration)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ascension 2: Increased slime attack + increased HP)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ascension 3: Increased slime attack range + increased boss count)<br>‌Endless Mode‌: Unlocked after Ascension 3.<br>‌Rankings‌: Expected to be based on Ascension 3 clear time.<\/p>","short_description":"Elemental Bomb‌ is a survivor-like game blended with Bomberman elements. You play as a mushroom in the forest, defeat slimes using bombs, collect drops and wave-clear rewards to grow stronger, and ultimately disrupt the slimes' ritual.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/b70204053b3df47ec25f0a99ff583f216e991278\/header.jpg?t=1793673050","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/551663add9b13c7d19e8aa423bb318cd22a99626\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793673050","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4961420\/551663add9b13c7d19e8aa423bb318cd22a99626\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793673050","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7\/8.1\/10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86_64 CPU, ARMv8 CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.0 support, Direct3D 12 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 150 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> basically all capable<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["荔枝加盐"],"publishers":["荔枝加盐"],"demos":[{"appid":5023900,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":389,"final":330,"discount_percent":15,"initial_formatted":"3,89€","final_formatted":"3,30€"},"packages":[1721649],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Elemental Bomb","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1721649,"percent_savings_text":"-15% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Elemental Bomb - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">3,89€<\/span> 3,30€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":330}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,